flowchart TB
    User[Candidate] --> Web[Next.js Web App]
    User --> Extension[Browser Extension]
    Web --> Gateway[FastAPI API Gateway]
    Extension --> Gateway

    Gateway --> Domains[Domain Services]
    Domains --> ACP[ACP Orchestrator]
    ACP --> Agents[Specialized AI Agents]
    Agents --> MCP[MCP Integration Layer]

    Domains --> Postgres[(PostgreSQL + pgvector)]
    Domains --> Redis[(Redis)]
    Domains --> Storage[(Object Storage)]
    ACP --> Queue[Event Bus / Worker Queues]
    Queue --> Workers[Workers]
    Workers --> MCP

    MCP --> JobBoards[Job Boards and ATS]
    MCP --> Google[Google Gmail / Calendar / Drive]
    MCP --> Github[GitHub]
    MCP --> Browser[Isolated Playwright Browser]
